# Two folders compared from the right-click menu; what is missing or newer on the left is
# copied to the right with a click, and then they agree.
open $T
select left | right
expect-menu-item Compare
action win.compare-folders
wait-compare-rows notes.txt ⇠ right newer | only-left.txt ⇢ only left | only-right.txt ⇠ only right | photos/ ⇢ only left | sub/report.txt ⇢ left newer
compare-show-identical on
wait-compare-rows notes.txt ⇠ right newer | only-left.txt ⇢ only left | only-right.txt ⇠ only right | photos/ ⇢ only left | same.txt = identical | sub/report.txt ⇢ left newer
compare-show-identical off
compare-copy right
wait-exists $T/right/photos/beach.jpg
wait-no-jobs
wait-compare-rows notes.txt ⇠ right newer | only-right.txt ⇠ only right
close-compare
